usage: niagara_help hierarchy [-h] [--depth DEPTH] [--chain] [--interface] name

positional arguments:
  name           Class name (e.g. BComponent)

options:
  -h, --help     show this help message and exit
  --depth DEPTH  Max depth for subclass tree (default: 2; 3 with --interface)
  --chain        Show inheritance chain upward
  --interface    Interface hierarchy: extends chain, sub-interfaces and implementors (replaces
                 interface-hierarchy)
